OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 100 hopefuls flock to
OL,4,Acafe to apply for single job
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 hopefuls descended on a
OL,7,FManchester cafe to apply for a
OL,8,Fpart-time barista role in what the
OL,9,Fmanager described as "whirlwind" of
OL,10,Finterest.
OL,12,FApplicants were invited to attend the
OL,13,FFig & Sparrow in the city's Northern
OL,14,FQuarter to present their CVs in person
OL,15,Frather than simply apply by email.
OL,17,FGeneral manager Luke Taylor, 32, said
OL,18,Fhe wanted to meet people face-to-face
OL,19,Fand added: "It shows how the job market
OL,20,Fis at the minute.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
